  { "The inner dust shell temperature is hypothesized to be constrained by the 3–4µm emission.": "maximum dust temperature lower than 900 K" },
  { "Models may require graphite or higher past mass-loss rates to fit far-IR flux.": "assuming a substantial abundance of graphite" }
],
"methodological_details": [
